    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dodge the obstacles and manage to beat your highscores in this arcade-style game!</strong></h2><br>You'll keep saying to yourself that this will be your final round, but it won't be. Your reward system inside your brain will be pushed to its limits, you won't be able to stop. Despite difficulty increasing with each passing second.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game offers:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3 difficulty levels!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Arcade based gameplay!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fantastic art-style and graphics!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over a hundred of different, randomly chosen level skin schemes!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Incredible soundtrack, which perfectly fits in the gameplay and blends with the rest of graphical design.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dodge the obstacles and manage to beat your highscores in this arcade-style game!</strong></h2><br>You'll keep saying to yourself that this will be your final round, but it won't be. Your reward system inside your brain will be pushed to its limits, you won't be able to stop. Despite difficulty increasing with each passing second.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game offers:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3 difficulty levels!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Arcade based gameplay!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fantastic art-style and graphics!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over a hundred of different, randomly chosen level skin schemes!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Incredible soundtrack, which perfectly fits in the gameplay and blends with the rest of graphical design.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "That's the final round, I swear this time, one last time for today... Final Rounds is a simple, yet highly addictive arcade game. Avoid the obstacles, enjoy the levels and beat your highscores!",
